    "body": "Releasing the writer works so long as releasing it does not lead the write being canceled. I believe it's fine now but I believe a [change](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#abstract-opdef-readablestreamdefaultreadererrorreadrequests) was recently made to `ReadableStream` that caused pending reads to be canceled. Are we certain a similar type of change won't be wanted with writers and would this interfere with that?",
    "created_at": "2025-01-24T00:07:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-01-24T00:07:18Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/streams/pull/1339#discussion_r1927904808",
