  {
    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/streams/pulls/comments/1928413527",
    "pull_request_review_id": 2572175799,
    "id": 1928413527,
    "node_id": "PRRC_kwDOANUOW85y8UFX",
    "diff_hunk": "@@ -4332,6 +4344,22 @@ as seen for example in [[#example-ws-no-backpressure]].\n  1. Return ! [$IsWritableStreamLocked$]([=this=]).\n </div>\n \n+<div algorithm>\n+ The <dfn id=\"ws-write\" method for=\"WritableStream\">write(|chunk|)</dfn> method steps are:\n+\n+ 1. Let |result| be ? [$AcquireWritableStreamDefaultWriter$]([=this=]).\n+ 1. If |result| is an abrupt completion, return [=a promise rejected with=] |result|.\\[[Value]].\n+ 1. Let |writer| be |result|.\\[[Value]].\n+ 1. Let |writePromise| be ! [$WritableStreamDefaultWriterWrite$](|writer|, |chunk|).\n+ 1. Return the result of [=reacting=] to |writePromise|:\n+  1. If |writePromise| is fulfilled with a value |v|, then:\n+   1. Perform ! [$WritableStreamDefaultWriterRelease$](|writer|).\n+   1. Return |v|.\n+  1. If |writePromise| is rejected with a value |r|, then:\n+   1. Perform ! [$WritableStreamDefaultWriterRelease$](|writer|).\n+   1. Return [=a promise rejected with=] |r|.",
    "path": "index.bs",
    "commit_id": "8368fd8a32e4c00c196830d5eb99aa16d1eddd06",
    "original_commit_id": "da646b81de986facecadaec953cc9baa7cb81277",
    "user": {
      "login": "MattiasBuelens",
      "id": 649348,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjY0OTM0OA==",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/649348?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/MattiasBuelens",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/MattiasBuelens",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MattiasBuelens/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MattiasBuelens/following{/other_user}",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MattiasBuelens/gists{/gist_id}",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MattiasBuelens/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MattiasBuelens/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MattiasBuelens/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MattiasBuelens/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MattiasBuelens/events{/privacy}",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MattiasBuelens/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "We don't need to wait for the `writePromise` to resolve or reject before releasing the lock. Instead, we should release it *immediately*.\r\n```suggestion\r\n 1. Let |writePromise| be ! [$WritableStreamDefaultWriterWrite$](|writer|, |chunk|).\r\n 1. Perform ! [$WritableStreamDefaultWriterRelease$](|writer|).\r\n 1. Return |writePromise|.\r\n```\r\nThis works, because [WritableStreamDefaultWriterRelease](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#writable-stream-default-writer-release) does not reject any pending write requests.\r\n\r\nThis also resolves https://github.com/whatwg/streams/pull/1339#issuecomment-2611228239.",
    "created_at": "2025-01-24T09:46:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-01-24T09:54:34Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/streams/pull/1339#discussion_r1928413527",
    "pull_request_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/streams/pulls/1339",
